@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ========================================
### Choreography Saga: "Assign & Notify"
### ========================================

### Step 1: Create a todo first
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete the choreography saga demo"
}

### Step 2 (Happy path): Assign todo to a valid user
### This triggers the event chain:
###   TodoAssignmentRequested -> UserValidated -> TodoAssignmentConfirmed -> NotificationSent
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/1/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1
}

### Step 3: Check the todo — status should be "assigned", user_id should be 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/1

### ========================================
### Compensation path: Invalid user
### ========================================

### Create another todo to test compensation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "This assignment will fail"
}

### Assign to a non-existent user
### This triggers: TodoAssignmentRequested -> UserValidationFailed -> TodoAssignmentRolledBack
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/2/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 999
}

### Check the todo — status should be "assignment_failed", user_id should be null
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/2
